{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28451","headline":"咏歌圣德远怀天宝因题关亭长句四韵 · 杜牧","name":"咏歌圣德远怀天宝因题关亭长句四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣敬文思业太平，海寰天下唱歌行。\n秋来气势洪河壮，霜後精神泰华狞。\n广德者强朝万国，用贤无敌是长城。\n君王若悟治安论，安史何人敢弄兵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28451.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28451","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}